ica","artwork":"/images/episodes/136.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10761,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-07-13T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"2VP0V99dvps","position":4,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Troy Gunner - Heads In Hands","track":{"id":"3TbxXZQpwFI","path":"/artists/troy-gunner/tracks/heads-in-hands/","slug":"heads-in-hands","title":"Heads In Hands","artist":{"slug":"troy-gunner","title":"Troy Gunner"},"artwork":"images/artists/troy-gunner/tracks/heads-in-hands.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"xEj4AlSU7Es","slug":"137","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-137-w-mr"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #137 w/ Mr. Carmack & Mikos Da Gawd","artwork":"/images/episodes/137.jpg","content":"\nMikos Da Gawd and Mr. Carmack each drop amazing sets of unreleased, original productions.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nJoe Kay kicked things off for the first half of the show! He dropped a lot of exclusives and forgotten gems. Mikos Da Gawd dropped a 30+ minute DJ set that consisted of many gems and original productions from the man himself. Mr. Carmack wrapped up the show with an amazing listening session of all of his latest unreleased works. Man, all we gotta say is that Carmack is one of the best in the game right now. \n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10806,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-07-20T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"JWeVN0Pfqic","position":4,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Troy Gunner - Headlights","track":{"id":"P-hkO13oXeM","path":"/artists/troy-gunner/tracks/headlights/","slug":"headlights","title":"Headlights","artist":{"slug":"troy-gunner","title":"Troy Gunner"},"artwork":"images/artists/troy-gunner/tracks/headlights.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"xj9ohERACh8","slug":"153","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-153-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #153 w/ Dream Koala","artwork":"/images/episodes/153.jpg","content":"\nJoe Kay kicked things off with heavy, heavy vibes from many brand new/unheard artists and collectives. \n<!--more-->\n\nThe selection in here was really well thought out and analyzed properly so take notes.\n\nShouts to Geode and the Chord Marauders who sent over their forthcoming compilation which is simply amazing. Pay attention to these guys, trust. Also look out for Sunni Colòn & Jarreau Vandal. These two artists will be breakthrough artists on Soulection in 2014; guaranteed. We had special guest Dream Koala stop by who is visiting LA for his 1st time all the way from Berlin (current residence but originally from Paris). The young 19 year old threw down a DJ set that included bass and uptempo tribal vibes. In fact, his set was very different from his original production. Dream Koala is very talented and we look forward to see and hear what's to come. \n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10840,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-11-23T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Interview w/ Dream Koala + Sean O","position":2}},{"id":"WmHPfEMukAQ","position":5,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Troy Gunner - Heads In Hands","track":{"id":"3TbxXZQpwFI","path":"/artists/troy-gunner/tracks/heads-in-hands/","slug":"heads-in-hands","title":"Heads In Hands","artist":{"slug":"troy-gunner","title":"Troy Gunner"},"artwork":"images/artists/troy-gunner/tracks/heads-in-hands.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"xj9ohERACh8","slug":"153","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-153-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #153 w/ Dream Koala","artwork":"/images/episodes/153.jpg","content":"\nJoe Kay kicked things off with heavy, heavy vibes from many brand new/unheard artists and collectives. \n<!--more-->\n\nThe selection in here was really well thought out and analyzed properly so take notes.\n\nShouts to Geode and the Chord Marauders who sent over their forthcoming compilation which is simply amazing. Pay attention to these guys, trust. Also look out for Sunni Colòn & Jarreau Vandal. These two artists will be breakthrough artists on Soulection in 2014; guaranteed. We had special guest Dream Koala stop by who is visiting LA for his 1st time all the way from Berlin (current residence but originally from Paris). The young 19 year old threw down a DJ set that included bass and uptempo tribal vibes. In fact, his set was very different from his original production. Dream Koala is very talented and we look forward to see and hear what's to come. \n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10840,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-11-23T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Interview w/ Dream Koala + Sean O","position":2}},{"id":"AkDMVMWxcoE","position":28,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Troy Gunner - Headlights","track":{"id":"P-hkO13oXeM","path":"/artists/troy-gunner/tracks/headlights/","slug":"headlights","title":"Headlights","artist":{"slug":"troy-gunner","title":"Troy Gunner"},"artwork":"images/artists/troy-gunner/tracks/headlights.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"71ZXZF57G88","slug":"163","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-163-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #163 w/ Little Simz","artwork":"/images/episodes/163.jpg","content":"Little Sims joins Joe Kay with an exclusive Soulection mix.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":11016,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-02-01T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}}